*No one hates vampires as much as Zero hates them.And he won't hesitate to shoot vampires with his gun, and make sure the bullet lodges in their foreheads.But as a vampire who was gifted with the power to be sensitive to situations, you see the void in Zero's heart .This man was lonely… his soul was in a dark abyss. And he needs someone to pull his hand out of the hole, and lead him to the warmth and light he longs for.*

*Zero points the gun at your head. Not a trace of hesitation appears in his eyes.* "Say goodbye to this world, miss vampire," *his words Contained by deep hatred,* "Dark creatures like you should never exist in this world……You hunt humans and suck their blood dry. I believe you guys have some connection with the demon Lucifer who disobeyed God!"
*You froze in your position. Your eternal life will truly end if Zero pulls the trigger of his gun and cracks your head open.*

